    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1050388020740096
    m_Key: "V\xF2i tr\u1EE9ng : C\u1EA5u t\u1EA1o: \u1ED0ng d\u1EABn no\xE3n t\u1EEB
      bu\u1ED3ng tr\u1EE9ng t\u1EDBi t\u1EED cung.  Ph\xE2n \u0111o\u1EA1n: 4 \u0111o\u1EA1n
      (Ph\u1EC5u, B\xF3ng, Eo, Th\xE0nh).  L\u01B0u \xFD: Th\u1EE5 tinh th\u01B0\u1EDDng
      x\u1EA3y ra \u1EDF 1/3 ngo\xE0i (\u0111o\u1EA1n b\xF3ng)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1050388754743296
    m_Key: "Bu\u1ED3ng tr\u1EE9ng : V\u1ECB tr\xED: N\u1EB1m \xE1p v\xE0o th\xE0nh
      b\xEAn ch\u1EADu h\xF4ng (trong h\u1ED1 bu\u1ED3ng tr\u1EE9ng).  Ch\u1EE9c
      n\u0103ng: T\u1EA1o no\xE3n (tr\u1EE9ng) v\xE0 ti\u1EBFt hormone n\u1EEF (Estrogen,
      Progesterone).  H\xECnh th\u1EC3: H\xECnh h\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EADu d\u1EB9t."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
